OL,3,GNEWSARail passengers warned as heavy
OL,4,Arainfall due
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers have been warned to
OL,7,Fcheck for delays or changes to their
OL,8,Fjourneys as heavy rainfall is due in
OL,9,FCumbria overnight.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail said it was monitoring
OL,12,Fforecasts of heavy rain expected over
OL,13,Fthe county, which the Met Office said
OL,14,Fwould continue until about 07:00 BST on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
